```

It is a useful minimal reference sector, but it is not the whole q79 carrier.

## 5. Transferred operations

Homological transfer gives

```text
m2(a,b)=p(ab),

m3(a,b,c)
 = p(h(ab)c-(-1)^|a| a h(bc)).
```

The exact execution evaluates all `88^3=681472` retained triples and obtains

```text
m3=0.
```

This is structural rather than accidental. For retained inputs, a nonzero
`h(ab)` is proportional to `u gamma` (possibly with `v`). Since
`gamma` is parallel to `delta`, it pairs trivially with every retained
`delta_perp` class, and its remaining products project to zero. Moreover,

```text
im(h)^2=0
```

because every homotopy image contains `u`, and `h` annihilates every product
already containing `u`. Every binary transfer tree of arity at least four
therefore also vanishes. The transferred model is strict:

```text
m1=0,
m2 survives,
mn=0 for n>=3.
```

